01:30.447 --> 01:35.447
An Opening

01:41.437 --> 01:43.017
<i>I'll have to teleport it away</i>
<i>with me!</i>

01:58.187 --> 01:59.687
You can have this back.

02:08.057 --> 02:09.227
Don't worry.

02:09.307 --> 02:10.977
I only teleported a clone.

02:12.057 --> 02:15.767
I marked him that last time
we were in contact.

02:22.227 --> 02:25.097
Amazing! You can copy
my dad's move!

02:25.187 --> 02:27.267
Impressive,
Second Great Stone Face-guy!

02:28.307 --> 02:30.647
Lord Fourth is using my move!

02:31.347 --> 02:33.517
And just call me "Lord Second"!

03:06.877 --> 03:08.877
Wood Style: Wood Dragon!

03:38.697 --> 03:39.997
Get out of my way, Madara!

03:40.247 --> 03:41.747
I don't have much time,

03:41.827 --> 03:44.627
but there's something
I've got to do now!

03:47.797 --> 03:50.127
Wood Style: Wood Golem Jutsu!

04:21.697 --> 04:23.827
I'm taking another chunk of you!

05:14.167 --> 05:15.217
A-Amazing!

05:15.507 --> 05:16.967
They're on a completely
different level!

05:17.757 --> 05:20.887
So this is the battle capacity
of our predecessors!

05:22.257 --> 05:24.177
If we went out there...

05:24.267 --> 05:26.687
we would just get
in their way for sure.

05:37.357 --> 05:42.077
We're of no use in
a battle like that.

05:45.787 --> 05:47.037
Ino, please!

05:47.327 --> 05:48.287
Got it.

05:53.167 --> 05:57.087
<i>Even a small power...</i>
<i>can be helpful.</i>

05:57.167 --> 05:58.257
It's Shikamaru...

05:58.587 --> 06:00.837
<i>We may not be any help now,</i>

06:00.837 --> 06:03.597
<i>but there might come a time</i>
<i>when we'll be needed.</i>

06:03.927 --> 06:06.307
<i>So don't take your eyes</i>
<i>off the battlefield.</i>

06:06.677 --> 06:08.137
<i>For if such a time arrives...</i>

06:08.227 --> 06:11.267
<i>our power could change</i>
<i>the course of this world!</i>

06:11.767 --> 06:14.227
<i>We can't afford to relax</i>
<i>and let our guard down,</i>

06:14.317 --> 06:15.937
<i>even for one second!</i>

06:17.647 --> 06:18.817
That's right.

06:18.897 --> 06:19.817
He's got a point...

06:20.357 --> 06:22.027
– Yeah...
– Yeah!

06:29.617 --> 06:32.877
<i>Shikamaru, you would make</i>
<i>a great Hokage.</i>

06:38.547 --> 06:43.967
<i>The ability to sway people's hearts</i>
<i>is practically a requisite of any Kage.</i>

07:03.697 --> 07:05.577
This is just like that time...

07:12.707 --> 07:15.497
<i>Madara, we were friends!</i>

07:16.497 --> 07:18.417
<i>And we shared the same dream!</i>

07:18.877 --> 07:19.967
<i>Hashirama!</i>

07:20.717 --> 07:23.007
<i>How long will you keep saying</i>
<i>such juvenile things?</i>

07:35.187 --> 07:39.567
<i>It's just not possible to show</i>
<i>our guts to each other!</i>

07:45.487 --> 07:47.027
<i>Hashirama!</i>

07:47.027 --> 07:48.987
<i>Madara!</i>

07:57.457 --> 07:59.837
The end result will be
different, though...

08:32.867 --> 08:35.247
<i>So when are we supposed</i>
<i>to make our move, Shikamaru?</i>

08:35.537 --> 08:39.167
<i>You should try to think</i>
<i>for yourself a little.</i>

08:39.917 --> 08:43.007
But first, we need to figure out
the circumstances of their battle.

08:43.627 --> 08:44.797
Also...

08:46.797 --> 08:48.547
<i>What's going on over there?</i>

08:55.187 --> 08:56.397
Did he get him?

09:14.867 --> 09:17.867
He blocked it, huh? He's fast.

09:18.827 --> 09:20.957
We won't be able to hit him
with ordinary jutsu.

09:27.297 --> 09:29.177
I guess I'll have to make an opening

09:29.257 --> 09:33.557
with my Rasen-Flash Super-Circle
Dance Howl Stage Three...

09:34.847 --> 09:37.937
You're a bit of a comedian,
aren't you?

09:38.477 --> 09:41.267
I'd normally make fun
of your jutsu names...

09:42.107 --> 09:44.067
Except this guy we're facing
is absolutely no joke.

09:44.777 --> 09:45.987
<i>Amaterasu!</i>

09:49.697 --> 09:52.987
Sasuke! Naruto! I said
I would create an opening for you!

09:53.487 --> 09:54.787
I'll do it!

09:54.787 --> 09:56.617
No, <i>we</i> will!

09:56.707 --> 09:58.667
We'll let Dad and the others
be the main act!

10:00.287 --> 10:03.377
I could tell you were
amassing chakra in your left eye.

10:03.997 --> 10:05.377
Hardly a surprise attack.

10:05.917 --> 10:07.377
Jeez!

10:08.087 --> 10:09.507
Let's go, Fourth.

10:10.177 --> 10:12.967
A clone's Flying Raijin
is much slower.

10:14.387 --> 10:16.977
Let's combine and
reciprocate our Flying Raijin.

10:17.137 --> 10:19.557
Go ahead and put your mark on me.

10:19.807 --> 10:20.977
Yes, sir.

10:21.557 --> 10:25.027
Plus with these bodies,
we can still move after being hit!

10:26.527 --> 10:31.067
Naruto, this time, I'll match
your chakra level using my Sharingan.

10:31.277 --> 10:34.827
No need to turn it into a competition!

10:39.327 --> 10:41.787
– Wind Style: Rasen Shuriken!
– Inferno Style: Flame Control!

10:52.087 --> 10:53.217
A pincer attack?

11:07.147 --> 11:08.567
<i>You two are the main act!</i>

11:09.697 --> 11:11.197
<i>Distracted by what's going on</i>
<i>in front of you?</i>

11:12.027 --> 11:12.817
Now!

11:12.987 --> 11:14.867
– Reciprocal Round-Robin Jutsu!
– Reciprocal Round-Robin Jutsu!

11:14.947 --> 11:16.277
– Flying Raijin Jutsu!
– Flying Raijin Jutsu!

11:19.907 --> 11:22.707
I name it the Scorch Style
Nimbus Tempest!

11:22.957 --> 11:24.627
Just keep on going as planned!

11:32.547 --> 11:35.467
<i>So they switched places</i>
<i>with the Flying Raijin?!</i>

11:42.977 --> 11:45.017
Hinata! What's going on with
Naruto and Sasuke?

11:57.077 --> 11:58.327
They're both...

12:01.157 --> 12:02.617
smiling...

12:08.207 --> 12:09.127
Smiling?

12:10.377 --> 12:11.377
Both of them?

12:11.467 --> 12:12.377
Yeah.

12:21.387 --> 12:22.637
All right!

12:23.477 --> 12:24.977
Did they get him?!

12:31.107 --> 12:34.357
I got in a direct hit before
those black things could protect him.

12:35.067 --> 12:36.737
He should have felt that one.

13:00.387 --> 13:01.927
No effect at all.

13:02.307 --> 13:05.057
We can't touch those black,
transforming spheres...

13:05.437 --> 13:07.307
Our attacks have
no effect on him...

13:07.727 --> 13:09.557
He's quick on both offense
and defense...

13:10.567 --> 13:11.527
What a pain.

13:13.487 --> 13:18.277
He's even more perfect than
how I imagine myself in my dreams!

13:19.117 --> 13:22.367
It's like he's truly obtained
dreamlike power.

13:24.327 --> 13:25.617
That's odd.

13:26.497 --> 13:27.617
What is?

13:28.627 --> 13:30.787
Your arm was ripped off...

13:31.087 --> 13:34.967
There should be dust swirling
around to restore it by now.

13:37.507 --> 13:39.967
Our reanimated bodies
aren't regenerating...

13:48.437 --> 13:53.437
I have come to possess the same power
as the Founder of Shinobi.

13:56.067 --> 13:59.567
You can no longer measure me
by the standards you are used to.

14:02.527 --> 14:04.947
Don't tell me, your jutsu...!

14:05.907 --> 14:09.497
What does he mean by the same power
as the Founder of Shinobi?

14:09.497 --> 14:10.627
Fourth...

14:11.417 --> 14:16.417
Try not to get seriously injured again,
even with our reanimated bodies...

14:17.257 --> 14:19.547
He's probably using
a jutsu based

14:19.627 --> 14:23.557
on Shadow and Light Styles
that nullify all ninjutsu.

14:24.597 --> 14:27.637
In other words, if he destroys
our reanimated bodies...

14:27.887 --> 14:30.557
we'll be unable to regenerate,
and we'll die!

14:32.857 --> 14:36.817
Also... assume that right arm
of yours is permanently gone.

14:37.937 --> 14:41.617
If that's the case, we'll need
to fight him even more carefully...

14:43.487 --> 14:46.447
But since ninjutsu won't work on him,
this will be tricky.

14:46.697 --> 14:48.657
How about physical attacks?

14:49.407 --> 14:50.497
Let's try it out.

14:51.667 --> 14:52.577
Sasuke...

14:52.707 --> 14:53.457
What?

14:53.917 --> 14:56.337
We're going to have to take the lead.

14:56.587 --> 14:57.917
Think you can keep up?

14:58.877 --> 15:00.587
Don't underestimate the Uchiha.

15:01.717 --> 15:02.837
All right!

15:03.087 --> 15:06.427
I'll up my Kurama Mode and
go into Tailed Beast State!

15:11.517 --> 15:12.807
Huh?

15:12.977 --> 15:14.807
Don't make things worse
than they already are...

15:16.517 --> 15:19.187
You're as goofy as your father.

15:19.947 --> 15:21.657
So much that even
he's dumbfounded...

15:22.817 --> 15:23.947
S-Sorry.

15:29.447 --> 15:32.827
Kurama! Lend me
a little more chakra!

15:33.497 --> 15:35.917
Hold off on going into
Nine Tails State for just a bit!

15:36.417 --> 15:38.757
But he's not someone
we can beat without it.

15:39.377 --> 15:42.257
If you want to enter into
Perfect Tailed Beast State,

15:42.337 --> 15:44.757
you're going to have to fight
in normal mode for a bit.

15:48.307 --> 15:50.597
Syrup Gun!

15:55.057 --> 15:56.477
A toad from Mount Myoboku?

15:56.857 --> 15:58.267
What was that about Gamakichi?

15:58.527 --> 16:00.937
If you're going make a move,
do something diversionary or a combo...

16:01.487 --> 16:05.277
Sorry, but we're approaching
the time limit for the summoning.

16:05.737 --> 16:08.987
I just wanted to repay him
with a parting shot!

16:09.867 --> 16:14.167
Thanks for the effort!
Go get some rest!

16:14.497 --> 16:16.077
Sorry about this.

16:33.517 --> 16:34.347
<i>This is...</i>

16:34.637 --> 16:38.147
Obito, I thought you wanted
to become Hokage.

16:38.517 --> 16:39.607
Why are you doing this?

16:39.857 --> 16:41.227
You want to know why?

16:42.397 --> 16:43.647
<i>This is my chance!</i>

16:44.237 --> 16:45.857
Lecturing me now?

16:46.407 --> 16:49.447
Isn't it a bit late for that... Sensei?

16:52.997 --> 16:56.497
You're always too late
when it matters most.

16:57.457 --> 17:01.587
<i>Anyway, Rin and Kakashi</i>
<i>are surrounded by dozens of shinobi!</i>

17:01.707 --> 17:06.467
<i>And it looks like they're all</i>
<i>powerful jonin and ANBU...</i>

17:06.467 --> 17:08.427
<i>What is Minato Sensei doing?</i>

17:08.547 --> 17:09.427
<i>Who's that?</i>

17:09.427 --> 17:12.177
<i>I'm asking you what</i>
<i>the Yellow Flash is doing!</i>

17:12.767 --> 17:17.097
<i>Hmm... He seems to be</i>
<i>on a different mission.</i>

17:17.727 --> 17:19.227
<i>At a time like this?</i>

17:25.987 --> 17:28.697
<i>Rin... I want to...</i>

17:30.027 --> 17:33.117
<i>I want to create a world</i>
<i>with you in it...</i>

17:34.867 --> 17:37.577
I'm glad my teacher was a Hokage.

17:42.297 --> 17:45.507
It made it easy to give up
on becoming Hokage.

17:49.137 --> 17:51.677
<i>He got past Lord Third's</i>
<i>personal ANBU Black Ops,</i>

17:52.057 --> 17:54.427
<i>infiltrated a top-secret barrier,</i>

17:55.017 --> 17:56.137
<i>and knew that the seal</i>

17:56.227 --> 17:58.557
<i>on the Nine Tails would be</i>
<i>at its weakest during childbirth...</i>

17:59.517 --> 18:02.357
<i>Are you Madara Uchiha?</i>

18:06.067 --> 18:10.487
<i>No... That's impossible...</i>
<i>He's dead.</i>

18:10.987 --> 18:13.487
<i>Who knows? Am I?</i>

18:14.657 --> 18:17.617
<i>Right now, I don't care who you are...</i>

18:19.037 --> 18:20.707
<i>But why are you targeting the Leaf?</i>

18:22.787 --> 18:27.837
<i>You could say it's on a whim,</i>
<i>but also as part of a plan,</i>

18:27.837 --> 18:32.847
<i>for the sake of war,</i>
<i>but also for the sake of peace.</i>

18:36.387 --> 18:40.227
<i>If I had realized that man</i>
<i>was Obito,</i>

18:40.347 --> 18:43.227
<i>I probably could have stopped him...</i>

18:44.147 --> 18:47.937
<i>And then, I might have been</i>
<i>able to prevent Kushina from dying.</i>

18:49.237 --> 18:50.947
<i>I might not have had</i>
<i>to make Naruto</i>

18:51.027 --> 18:53.117
<i>into Nine Tails' Jinchuriki.</i>

18:54.697 --> 18:55.867
<i>If only...</i>

18:56.697 --> 18:59.117
<i>I had realized he was Obito...</i>

19:00.207 --> 19:04.877
<i>Perhaps the shinobi world wouldn't</i>
<i>have ended up like this either!</i>

19:05.797 --> 19:09.717
Even though you were my teacher,
you didn't realize it was me.

19:10.337 --> 19:13.757
That's just who
you are fundamentally.

19:14.387 --> 19:15.757
How pathetic...

19:16.057 --> 19:18.517
You died a heroic Hokage,

19:18.597 --> 19:21.387
